<Layouts.app
  flash={@flash}
  current_scope={@current_scope}
  locale={@locale}
  translated_path={if(@locale == "fr", do: ~p"/en/strategy", else: ~p"/fr/strategie")}
>
  <article id="strategy" class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-16 sm:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">{gettext("Executive summary")}</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-heading text-5xl leading-tight text-stone-950 sm:text-6xl">
      {gettext("Our strategy")}
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-xl leading-9 text-stone-700">
      {gettext(
        "Sound policy is not enough if nobody builds the public support needed to enact it. PauseAI Canada aims to help informed people act together before a crisis forces governments to improvise."
      )}
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {gettext("The problem")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {gettext(
            "Even persuaded policymakers hesitate to defend costly measures without visible support. A political window may open suddenly, but that is too late to build the trust, teams, and networks it requires."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {gettext("Our approach")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {gettext(
            "Inform without prescribing a conclusion, offer one attainable first action, then help willing participants talk, show up, contribute, and organize."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {gettext("What we measure")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {gettext(
            "Real actions that indicate progress: learning, conversations, participation, political contact, volunteering, and organizing. Each person's activity log remains private."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
      <section class="rounded-3xl border border-stone-200 bg-white p-7">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl text-stone-950">
          {gettext("What we avoid")}
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-7 text-stone-600">
          {gettext(
            "No leaderboards, streak pressure, or claim that one path fits everyone. Progress is used to offer a next step, not to score people."
          )}
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section
      id="engagement-ladder"
      class="mt-12 rounded-[2rem] bg-stone-900 p-8 text-white sm:p-10"
    >
      <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl">
        {gettext("Engagement ladder")}
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-white/70">
        {gettext("There is no single path. These are common ways to deepen your involvement.")}
      </p>
      <ol class="mx-auto mt-8 flex max-w-2xl flex-col-reverse px-2 sm:px-8">
        <li
          :for={{step, i} <- Enum.with_index(PauseAiCa.Engagement.Ladder.steps(@locale), 1)}
          class="border-x-[8px] border-white/30 px-5 pb-6"
        >
          <div class="border-t-[8px] border-white/30 pt-3">
            <strong class="block">{i}. {step.title}</strong>
            <span class="mt-1 block text-sm text-white/70">{step.examples}</span>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>

    <p class="mt-10 text-sm leading-6 text-stone-500">
      {gettext(
        "This summary adapts PauseAI's movement-building analysis to the Canadian context. Read the full argument for its evidence and caveats (about 42 minutes)."
      )}
      <a
        class="ml-1 font-semibold text-stone-800 underline decoration-brand underline-offset-4"
        href="https://www.lesswrong.com/posts/aoqhszdEWqcFWbnda/existential-ai-safety-needs-an-effective-social-movement"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noreferrer"
      >{gettext("Read the original article ↗")}</a>
    </p>
  </article>
</Layouts.app>
